      <marc:subfield code="a">The once-great city lies in ruins. A massive gash in the fabric of our reality roils against the horizon as it blends into a permanently darkenedsky. The world as we know it has ccome to an end. Demons, the visions of our noghtmare, walk the earth. Mankind, driven in retreat to the sanctuary of the Underground, struggles to survive the Hellish apocalypse. AMong the survivors are those who forsaw the coming of the darkness, those who see itt as an opportunity to improve the standing of man, and those who seek revenge for what was lost.All are now banding together in the shadows, arming themselves with futuristic weapons and arcane spells designed for one purpose-to battle the demonic ordes anad take back their world.</marc:subfield>
